WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.197 --> 00:00:03.697
(light music)

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:08.922
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:16.452 --> 00:00:17.619
- [Narrator] In the center of Havana,

00:00:17.619 --> 00:00:18.848
there's a pair of entrepreneurs

00:00:18.848 --> 00:00:22.598
who are taking pizza
delivery to new heights.

00:00:32.781 --> 00:00:36.698
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:06.822
- [Narrator] In 2010,
Marta number one

00:01:06.822 --> 00:01:09.157
and her husband were granted
a private business license,

00:01:09.157 --> 00:01:10.609
and opened up a pizzeria.

00:01:10.609 --> 00:01:12.869
A few months ago, her husband passed away.

00:01:12.869 --> 00:01:15.681
Now her best friend is helping
her keep the pizzeria alive.

00:01:15.681 --> 00:01:19.598
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:23.332 --> 00:01:24.413
- [Narrator] Since then the pizzeria,

00:01:24.413 --> 00:01:26.430
which operates from
Marta number one's roof,

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:29.014
has filled countless stomachs
with their secret recipe.

00:01:29.014 --> 00:01:32.931
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:59.472 --> 00:02:00.305
- [Narrator] Ever since Marta number two

00:02:00.305 --> 00:02:02.271
joined Marta number one in business,

00:02:02.271 --> 00:02:05.218
the two have formed a true partnership.

00:02:05.218 --> 00:02:09.135
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:25.023 --> 00:02:27.940
(melancholy music)

